    "direct": "he -> L -> Gt.post -> gr -> Rt.request with host=frame, auth=claude-ai-oauth; LS(frame)=rct()??dn().BASE_API_URL. rct returns undefined in this build; normal prod base is https://api.anthropic.com.",
    "relay": "$er -> L -> Gt.post -> gr with host=ccr-gateway and auth=session-jwt, after avs rewrites /api/frame/track to ${Gh()}/frame/track. Normal session prefix is /v1/code/sessions/<id>/agent-proxy; tunnel route can use a configured approved frame host.",
    "gates": "ker itself has no telemetry-specific gate. Shared API policy US refuses essential-traffic-only or non-firstParty providers; direct route requires suitable Claude.ai OAuth; relay selection is gated by session context/feature flags. optional-off deliberately leaves the broad Tt-related functional gates intact."
  },
